# Template for .env -- copy it, then fill in your own key:
#
#   Copy-Item .env.example .env
#
# .env is gitignored and must stay that way. Never put a real key in this
# file, or in any other tracked file: a key that reaches a commit must be
# treated as leaked and rotated at the provider, because deleting the commit
# does not unpublish it.
#
# Read at cli.py's entry point. A real OPENAI_API_KEY already in the
# environment takes precedence over this file.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
